WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.819
Wear the PPE required for the task and check it before use.

2
00:00:03.819 --> 00:00:05.591
Replace damaged PPE.

3
00:00:05.591 --> 00:00:09.958
Use tools, ladders, guards, and controls only as trained.

4
00:00:09.958 --> 00:00:12.330
Do not bypass a guard to save time.

5
00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:17.645
If equipment behaves differently, stop it safely, label or isolate it as

6
00:00:17.645 --> 00:00:20.302
required, and tell the responsible person.
